{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46771","headline":"谢王先辈湘中回惠示卷轴 · 齐己","name":"谢王先辈湘中回惠示卷轴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少小即怀风雅情，独能遗象琢淳精。\n不教霜雪侵玄鬓，便向云霄换好名。\n携去湘江闻鼓瑟，袖来缑岭伴吹笙。\n多君百首贻衰飒，留把吟行访竺卿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46771.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46771","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}